  "id": "def-sfb-dcons-subfield",
  "kind": "definition",
  "title": "$D_{\\mathrm{cons}}(X,E)$",
  "statement": "For a prime $\\ell$, a scheme $X$ and a finite extension $E$ of $\\mathbf Q_\\ell$ inside $\\Qlb$,\n$D_{\\mathrm{cons}}(X,E)$ is the bounded constructible derived category\n([sk-def-sfb-bounded-constructible]) of modules over the coefficient ring\n$E_X=p_X^*\\underline E$: the full subcategory of $D(\\Mod_{E_X})$ of complexes that are bounded\nand have constructible cohomology sheaves.",
